### Scientific Conclusion
**`TEMPORAL TRANSFORMER DEGRADED PERFORMANCE`**

Under the 40-episode training budget on the 2x2 grid network, adding multi-head self-attention and temporal historical tokens increased model capacity and sample complexity, resulting in higher policy entropy ($1.21$ vs $0.53$) and suboptimal actuation timing relative to the reactive Markovian MAPPO baseline.
